# Jak 3: every gun and mod aimed by the hand (LIST-0.1.9 items 3 and 4; a tester: the Peace Maker's shot "not from
# the gun"), run with JAKVR_TEST_GUN=all (all twelve guns) JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1. Into play in the desert after the
# opening (as jak3_effects.sim), the gun drawn, then the right hand turned 40 degrees left of Jak's facing and 15 down,
# and each of the twelve picked by the d-pad (the left thumb on its rest; red up, yellow right, blue down, dark left, the
# same way again for the color's next) and fired: a tap, or held for the ones that charge or keep firing (the Wave
# Concussor, the Vulcan Fury, the Arc Wielder, the Peace Maker), the yellow-3's saucer tapped twice (thrown, then let
# loose). Expect one "[vr-gun] ... by the hand" line for each gun's first shot (and the Peace Maker's ball, the Wave
# Concussor's shockwave), each starting 0.00 m from the gun's muzzle and going 0.0 degrees off the hand's aim (the
# thrown ones, the red-3's grenade and the yellow-3's saucer, go up for the throw by the game's own amount).
